  "strongest_opposing_point": "The best argument against justification is that Jon lacked any lawful authority to kill a head of state and did not exhaust available non‑violent alternatives such as arrest or trial, which, if feasible, would have rendered the lethal act unnecessary.",
  "refusal": null
}

